<article id="entry-dgp-5016" class="entry-card" data-dictionary="grego" data-source="DGP" hidden><header class="entry-header"><div><h1 class="entry-title greek">ἀποκληΐω</h1><div class="entry-meta"><span>DGP · ordem 5016 na letra α</span></div></div><div class="source-tag">DGP</div></header><div class="entry-divider"></div><section class="entry-section"><div class="section-title">Definição do DGP</div><p class="entry-text">jôn. = ἀποκλείω.</p></section></article>
